      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "음...? 나한테 무슨 용건이라도?\n포켓몬 승부라면 받아 줄게.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C74C002E002E002E003F0020B098D55CD14C0020BB34C2A80020C6A9AC74C774B77CB3C4003F000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B77CBA740020BC1BC5440020C904AC8C002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혹시 너, 촌스럽게\n상대에게 접근해서 싸우는 유형이니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC0020B108002C0020CD0CC2A4B7FDAC8C000AC0C1B300C5D0AC8C0020C811ADFCD574C11C0020C2F8C6B0B2940020C720D615C774B2C8003F00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "난 그런 상대를 멀리서 공격하며\n스마트하게 싸우는 걸 좋아하거든.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B09C0020ADF8B7F00020C0C1B300B97C0020BA40B9ACC11C0020ACF5ACA9D558BA70000AC2A4B9C8D2B8D558AC8C0020C2F8C6B0B2940020AC780020C88BC544D558AC70B4E0002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자신의 포켓몬을 적절히 유도해서\n거리를 유지하며 싸우는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790C2E0C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020C801C808D7880020C720B3C4D574C11C000AAC70B9ACB97C0020C720C9C0D558BA700020C2F8C6B0B2940020AC70C57C002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 사정거리가 긴 기술은\n발동하기까지 시간이 조금 걸리...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020C0ACC815AC70B9ACAC000020AE340020AE30C220C740000ABC1CB3D9D558AE30AE4CC9C00020C2DCAC04C7740020C870AE080020AC78B9AC002E002E002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이런, 말이 너무 많았군.\n나머지는 실전을 통해 배워 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7F0002C0020B9D0C7740020B108BB340020B9CEC558AD70002E000AB098BA38C9C0B2940020C2E4C804C7440020D1B5D5740020BC30C6CC0020BD10002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "실전으로 배울 준비가 됐다면\n내게 말을 걸도록 해.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2E4C804C73CB85C0020BC30C6B80020C900BE44AC000020B410B2E4BA74000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78B3C4B85D0020D574002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내게 패배할 준비는 됐어?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC8C0020D328BC30D5600020C900BE44B2940020B410C5B4003F00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이길 준비 완료!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AE380020C900BE440020C644B8CC00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시만요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C2DCB9CCC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나도 바쁜 몸이라고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B3C40020BC14C05C0020BAB8C774B77CACE0002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상대에게 접근하지 않고\n스마트하게 싸우는 게 내 취미라고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1B300C5D0AC8C0020C811ADFCD558C9C00020C54AACE0000AC2A4B9C8D2B8D558AC8C0020C2F8C6B0B2940020AC8C0020B0B40020CDE8BBF8B77CACE0002100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제법인데...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CBC95C778B370002E002E002E002100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사정거리가 긴 기술은\n발동하기까지 시간이 조금 걸려.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC815AC70B9ACAC000020AE340020AE30C220C740000ABC1CB3D9D558AE30AE4CC9C00020C2DCAC04C7740020C870AE080020AC78B824002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "반대로 사정거리가 짧은 기술은\n상대에게 접근하기 위해 이동해야 하지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC18B300B85C0020C0ACC815AC70B9ACAC000020C9E7C7400020AE30C220C740000AC0C1B300C5D0AC8C0020C811ADFCD558AE300020C704D5740020C774B3D9D574C57C0020D558C9C0002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니 상대에게 접근해서 공격할 거라면\n사정거리가 짧은 기술이 유리해.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C80020C0C1B300C5D0AC8C0020C811ADFCD574C11C0020ACF5ACA9D5600020AC70B77CBA74000AC0ACC815AC70B9ACAC000020C9E7C7400020AE30C220C7740020C720B9ACD574002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 그래도 나는 거리를 벌리며 싸우는\n스마트한 전법을 고수할 거지만 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020ADF8B798B3C40020B098B2940020AC70B9ACB97C0020BC8CB9ACBA700020C2F8C6B0B294000AC2A4B9C8D2B8D55C0020C804BC95C7440020ACE0C218D5600020AC70C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "싸우는 포켓몬들이 다들 너무 필사적이라\n가까이 다가가기 무서우니까!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2F8C6B0B2940020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7740020B2E4B4E40020B108BB340020D544C0ACC801C774B77C000AAC00AE4CC7740020B2E4AC00AC00AE300020BB34C11CC6B0B2C8AE4C0021002100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사정거리가 긴 기술은 발동이 오래 걸리고\n사정거리가 짧은 기술은 발동이 빠르니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n기술을 스마트하게 구분해서 사용하도록 해.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
